<title>USA: Nortek Q3 shr rises to $0.64 from $0.41.</title>
<headline>Nortek Q3 shr rises to $0.64 from $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>9/28/96		   9/30/95</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.64		    $0.41</p>
<p> Net		 6,500		    5,200</p>
<p> Sales	     248,227		  193,567</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,162		   12,579</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.35		    $0.86</p>
<p> Net		 14,700		   10,900</p>
<p> Sales	     729,447		  572,582</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,845		   12,663</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Full company name is Nortek Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the third quarter 1995 included a $2.2 million pre-tax gain or $0.17 per share on investment and marketable securities. The company said third quarter results reflected strong product demand and better profit margins.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
